Let's see how the example of the roses would look like. If we
make some more concrete assignments:

X xi'i Y:  X and Y have coordinate scope
X xi'a Y:  X has scope over Y
X xi'u Y:  Y has scope over X

then we have:

        ci nanmu xa rozgu vo ninmu xi'a ry dunda

Not too bad. Or another way to say the same thing:

        ci nanmu xa rozgu xi'u vo'i vo ninmu cu dunda

Those two would mean the same as:

        ci nanmu vo ninmu xa rozgu cu setese dunda

